00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,502
Watch how subtle camera movements can dramatically increase tension in films, keeping audiences on the edge of their seats.

2
00:00:06,502 --> 00:00:15,058
In key scenes, filmmakers often use slow pushes or pulls to build suspense, guiding your eyes to the crucial elements of the shot.

3
00:00:15,058 --> 00:00:22,419
By carefully manipulating the camera, they create a sense of impending danger or reveal hidden threats, enhancing the overall emotional impact.

4
00:00:22,419 --> 00:00:27,585
Understanding these techniques can help you appreciate the skill behind crafting suspenseful scenes.
